  "body": "Running develop (with py3) on the ``event_creator`` worker produces this little message and causes the thing to exit:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<Half-Shot> Sep 13 20:08:14 Halfy-VM python[4085]:   File \"/srv/matrix/synapse/lib/python3.6/site-packages/synapse/storage/user_directory.py\", line 577, in get_current_state_deltas\r\n<Half-Shot> Sep 13 20:08:14 Halfy-VM python[4085]:     if not self._curr_state_delta_stream_cache.has_any_entity_changed(prev_stream_id):\r\n<Half-Shot> Sep 13 20:08:14 Halfy-VM python[4085]: AttributeError: 'EventCreatorSlavedStore' object has no attribute '_curr_state_delta_stream_cache'\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere is more to the logs, but that seemed like the critical bit to grab at the time. I can dig further if needed.",
